              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wayimwenesheleli kwejima kwi-ndo, kwazo-o, mwomwayisanyikililiyi ankakulula jawu; ayilumbu jawu ejima kwosi niwumu wamweni kudikaŋa nawuku. Yehova wayinkeli ayilumbu jawu ejima. ",
